          <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 20px;">
            <tr><td style="padding:4px 8px 4px 0;vertical-align:top;width:16px;color:#f59e0b;font-weight:bold;">&#10003;</td><td style="padding:4px 0;"><strong>Top up your listings</strong> — more products live means more chances to be found. Send us your catalog on WhatsApp and we'll upload it for you, or add items yourself in a few taps</td></tr>
