          </table>
          <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Need a hand? Our team is on standby all week — WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/254727854903" style="color:#111827;"><strong>+254&nbsp;727&nbsp;854&nbsp;903</strong></a> or call <strong>+254&nbsp;712&nbsp;990&nbsp;524</strong> and we'll help you list, fix photos, or update prices.</p>
          <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 8px;">
            <tr><td style="background:#f59e0b;border-radius:999px;">
